                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On September 5, the Jordanian Cabinet decided that Crown Prince Talal of Jordan should be proclaimed King the
                    following day upon his arrival in Jordan from Switzerland. On September 6, he
                    took the oath to uphold the Constitution in the presence of both houses of
                    Parliament.</p>
            </div>
